cott-domain curriculum.json_transform.wrap_scalar_json return: return the cott_runtime JsonValue ABI object JsonObject(value=FrozenMap(values={key: JsonString(value=value)})), importing JsonObject, JsonString, FrozenMap and JsonValue from cott_runtime; never return a plain Python dict or str.
cott-domain curriculum.json_transform.extract_string_field return: annotate payload as cott_runtime JsonValue; return Err(JsonTransformError_NotAnObject()) unless isinstance(payload, JsonObject), look up payload.value.get(field), and return Err(JsonTransformError_MissingField(field_name=field)) unless that entry is a JsonString; on success return Ok(value=<entry>.value). cott_runtime has no Json symbol and JSON values are never plain dict or str.
